       EXAMPLE negation_example_01
       "They don't know our language very well yet."
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <Example id="negation_example_01" topic="negation">
    <Label>François (2011a, p. 178)</Label>
    <Tier lang="num">nir βitis ɣil liŋliŋi mi u luwluw namɣin</Tier>
    <Tier lang="drg">nɪr sɔwsɛ βrɪɣɪl taβul tɛ na lŋa ‑ɣɪn</Tier>
    <Tier lang="kro">nɪr tɪ rɔŋ taβul wʊs.mɛlɛ ɔ βalβalaw namɪɣɪn</Tier>
    <Tier lang="olr">nɪj tɪ rɔŋ βɪlɪː wʊs.mɛlɛ — ususraː mʊʧ</Tier>
    <Tier lang="lkn">ɣɪː atɪ rɔŋ kɛrɛ aβʊh.malɛ — ɛlŋa ‑nɣɪʧ</Tier>
    <Glosses>3PL NONDUM₁ know properly NONDUM₂ ART speech POSS:1INCL.PL</Glosses>
    <Translation lang="eng">They don’t know our language very well yet</Translation>
